## 6. Implementation checklist (dev/producer view)

Before launch, run your system against this checklist:

* [ ] No references to **loans, APR, interest, repayment periods** anywhere player-facing.
* [ ] All “Advance” systems use **in-game items & currencies only**; no external financial products.
* [ ] Clear “Advance Challenge” panel that lists **Rewards, Goal, Deadline, Outcomes**.
* [ ] Obvious “No thanks” choice; no forced contracts, no sneaky opt-ins.
* [ ] Base game is competitive and fun **without** ever touching an Advance contract.
* [ ] Failure outcomes always include **a free path** (lose some extra stuff) alongside **optional gem settlement**.
* [ ] Analytics: track contract uptake, completion, failure, churn, and spending to tune difficulty and rewards.
* [ ] Store listing explains the system in **plain, non-financial terms** (“optional early unlock challenges”).
* [ ] Financial features declaration: set to **no financial features**, since you are not doing loans/credit in the real-world sense. ([Google Help][3])
* [ ] UX & legal review for **dark patterns**, to ensure you’re not using deception or pressure tactics. ([Google Play][1])

